```
$ jci-coverage --help
Generate source-based Rust code coverage with cargo-llvm-cov and
upload the report to OtterWise for code quality reporting. `report`
and `upload` are independent: `upload` works standalone against any
coverage file, Rust or not.

Usage: jci-coverage [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  report  Generate a coverage report with cargo-llvm-cov
  upload  Upload a coverage report to OtterWise
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose...
          Increase logging verbosity

  -q, --quiet...
          Decrease logging verbosity

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version

```
